  "_comment": [
    "Alias table for parsing Tamil (and general) music filenames.",
    "Keys are canonical names; values are lowercase alias forms as they actually",
    "appear in downloaded filenames. Matching is done on a normalised string",
    "(lowercased, punctuation stripped, whitespace collapsed), so 'A.R. Rahman',",
    "'AR Rahman' and 'a r rahman' all collapse to the same probe key.",
    "",
    "Why this exists: MusicBrainz coverage of Tamil film music is thin, so for a",
    "large share of the library the filename IS the metadata. Knowing that a",
    "segment is a music director rather than a movie is what lets us assign the",
    "fields correctly instead of guessing by position."
  ],

