  "_split_junk_comment": [
    "These phrases sit BETWEEN the song title and the film name in YouTube-rip",
    "filenames, e.g. 'Pakkam Vanthu - Video Song Kaththi Vijay ... Anirudh'.",
    "They are therefore delimiters, not merely noise: deleting them destroys the",
    "only structural signal such a filename carries. Ordered longest-first so the",
    "most specific phrase wins the split."
  ],
  "split_junk": [
    "official video song", "official lyrical video", "official lyric video",
    "official music video", "official video", "official audio", "official song",
    "full video song", "full video", "full audio song", "full audio", "full song",
