  "_tamil_markers_comment": [
    "Transliterated Tamil words that are common in song titles. A hit here is a",
    "weak-but-free hint that the track is Tamil, used only to seed the language",
    "guess before the audio-based VoxLingua classifier runs. Native Tamil script",
    "(U+0B80..U+0BFF) is a much stronger signal and is detected in code."
  ],
